    length: 6-8 cells (bar center to grid edge, exclusive of center)
    only target_color pixels appear on the ray (no bar/control pixels)
  transform: erase (set to bg) every target object whose any pixel lies on the ray; keep all else

generation_strategy:
  approach: output-first
  steps:
    1. Pick grid size (9-14 x 10-13), bar axis (H/V), and ray direction (one of 4 cardinal dirs consistent with axis)
    2. Place bar center so ray length is 6-8 and bar does not touch grid edge; place bar (3 cells) and control (1 cell)
